  "section": "3.275",
  "rulesText": "Cost: 1 Sorcery Point\n\nWhen you cast a spell that deals a type of damage from the following list, you can spend 1 Sorcery Point to change that damage type to one of the other listed types: Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, Poison, Thunder."
}
